BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_317546976@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261128T072800Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261201T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261201T201500
SUMMARY:Tuesday brews day- Burial Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nIt's time to make the pilgrimage back to Bu
 rial Brewing. It seems to be the holiday favorite. This is a fun run with 
 lots of hills and switchbacks.\nWinter's here so dress accordingly. Please
  wear bright/ reflective clothing and headlamps. We'll meet out front.\n\n
 3 miler: : Right out of\nbrewery onto collier. R on buxton\, Brief L onto 
 South Lexington\, Left on Church st\, Right on\nHilliard\, continue past B
 iltmore\, Right on Beaumont\, Left on Charlotte\, cross over 240\, Right o
 n Arlington\, continue\nRight onto Cameron\, Right on Town Mountain\, Cont
 inue onto MLK Jr.\, Left on Charlotte. Continue onto Southside. Right on C
 oxe. Right on Buxton\, R Collier.\n\n5 Miler: Right out of\nbrewery onto c
 ollier. R on buxton\, Brief L onto South Lexington Left on Church st\, Rig
 ht on Hilliard\, continue past Biltmore\, Right on\nBeaumont\, Left on Cha
 rlotte\, cross over\n240\, Right on Arlington\, continue Right onto Camero
 n\, Right on Town\nMountain\, Left on Tunnel\, Right on\nCollege St\, cont
 inue Left on college (do not go straight on Beaumont)\, Right on\nWindswep
 t\, Right on Alexander\, Left on Ardimon\, Left on Carroll\, Left on MLK J
 r\, Left on Charlotte. Continue onto Southside. Right on Coxe. Right on Bu
 xton\, R collier.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/317546976/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261123T040049Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261123T040049Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_317421650@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261128T072800Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/317421650/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261113T231946Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261113T231946Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
